    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oburima bwOMWAMI khuYuda shibumootsolokha ta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI niyasunjila mbu Kata Musa naSamweli nibakhaba nibasinjiile imbeli wanje, omwoyo kwanje shikwakhanyala okhushiukhanila abandu bano ta; obarume barule mumoni tsianje, batsie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa balakhureeba mbu Kho khurule nikhutsia heena? Olababoolela mbu Kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola; mbu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI aboola mbu Ndalaraho hekulu wabwe abatibii betsimbia tsine; mbu olukanga okhwira, netsimbwa okhumaanya, namanyonyi akomwikulu netsisolo etsiomushialo okhulia nohumalilana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalabakhola babe eshiriisio mubwami bwosi bweshialo, khulwa Manase waHezekia omuruchi waYuda, khulwako aka yakhola muYerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Woowe, mama ko! Wanzibula embe omundu wobusoolo nowamayinje mushialo shiosi! Shindahosia omundu eshindu kata abandu shibayahosiakhwo nebutswa banyekanga, bosi pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabe kario, OMWAMI, nimba nindabasabiile amalayi, kata nimba nindakhusaayile khulwa abasuku abo mundaalo tsiamasila nomundaalo tsiamatinyu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yakhanyala okhufunaka eshibia, mbu eshibia eshirula enotsi, nomukasa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emianduchio namabiikhoko, ndalabihaana okhuyaaywa harali obukusi ta, khulwa ebionoonobio biosi mumbalitsio tsiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndalachila nokhalabanila abasuku beenywe mushialo eshia oramanyile ta; okhuba muburima bwanje omulilo kuhambiibwe, okulaakhanga inziayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.15.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka OMWAMI yasuubisia Yeremia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
